From 00daebba0fec515d37e6b023dc76b6f2b805516a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Will Twomey <william.twomey@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:57:08 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 01/14] arm64: dts: rockchip: port FriendlyElec nanopi6/CM3588
 DTS from nanopi6-v6.1.y

Copied wholesale from friendlyarm/kernel-rockchip nanopi6-v6.1.y
(6.1.141). Replaying their history doesn't work (174 of 300 picks fail
on this base). Rockchip's newer rk3588 dtsi merged the separate
hdptxphy_hdmiN nodes into combo hdptxphyN PHYs (which are also the clock
providers), so the references are renamed; this matches rk3588-evb.dtsi.
The rev09 (CM3588) DTB differs from FriendlyElec's only in that and in the
PVTM nodes Rockchip dropped.
